@@ -96,0 +98,3 @@ The current operation evidence is deliberately narrower than `*mut` parity:
+| `cast::<u8>`, `addr`, `with_addr`, `map_addr` on a u32 pointer | diagnosed at differing-pointee casts inside the standard-library helpers; use the explicit-u64 library for address transport |
+| `wrapping_byte_add`, `wrapping_byte_sub`, `wrapping_byte_offset` on a u32 pointer | diagnosed at the helpers' casts to byte/unit pointers; the element-offset results above do not establish byte-helper support |
